    "Info" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the Info box, which describes a wallpaper (type, resolution, size, tags) or a playlist (its wallpapers, timing, transition): at the top of a wallpaper's inspector, in a playlist's Home inspector and in the Workshop's detail pane.",
      "localizations" : {
