    "Open Steam Settings and choose Install Steam tools. Wallpaper Mage downloads Valve’s tool for you." : {
      "comment" : "Error message. “Steam Settings” is the Steam tab of Settings, “Install Steam tools” its button: use the same words as there. “Wallpaper Mage” is the app's name: keep it unchanged in every language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffne die Steam-Einstellungen und wähle „Steam-Tools installieren“. Wallpaper Mage lädt das Tool von Valve für dich herunter."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Άνοιξε τις Ρυθμίσεις Steam και επίλεξε «Εγκατάσταση εργαλείων Steam». Το Wallpaper Mage κατεβάζει το εργαλείο της Valve για σένα."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abre Ajustes de Steam y selecciona “Instalar herramientas de Steam”. Wallpaper Mage descargará la herramienta de Valve por ti."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abre Configuración de Steam y elige Instalar herramientas de Steam. Wallpaper Mage descargará la herramienta de Valve por ti."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ouvre les Réglages Steam et choisis « Installer les outils Steam ». Wallpaper Mage télécharge l’outil de Valve pour toi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam設定を開いて「Steamツールをインストール」を選んでね。Wallpaper MageがValveのツールをダウンロードしてくれるよ。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 설정을 열고 Steam 도구 설치를 선택해 줘. Wallpaper Mage가 Valve의 도구를 대신 다운로드해 줄 거야."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Otwórz Ustawienia Steam i wybierz „Zainstaluj narzędzia Steam”. Wallpaper Mage pobierze za ciebie narzędzie od Valve."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abra os Ajustes da Steam e escolha Instalar ferramentas da Steam. O Wallpaper Mage baixa a ferramenta da Valve para você."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Открой настройки Steam и нажми «Установить инструменты Steam». Wallpaper Mage сам загрузит инструмент Valve."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam Ayarları’nı aç ve “Steam araçlarını yükle” düğmesine tıkla. Wallpaper Mage, Valve’ın aracını senin için indirir."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Відкрий Параметри Steam і вибери «Інсталювати інструменти Steam». Wallpaper Mage викачає інструмент Valve автоматично."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Steam 设置，然后选择“安装 Steam 工具”。Wallpaper Mage 会帮你下载 Valve 的工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Steam Settings and sign in with the Steam account that owns Wallpaper Engine." : {
      "comment" : "Error message.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffne die Steam-Einstellungen und melde dich mit dem Steam-Konto an, das Wallpaper Engine besitzt."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Άνοιξε τις Ρυθμίσεις Steam και συνδέσου με τον λογαριασμό Steam που διαθέτει το Wallpaper Engine."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abre Ajustes de Steam e inicia sesión con la cuenta de Steam que tiene Wallpaper Engine."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
